24
 months and are designated as accounting hedges.As of September¬†27, 2025 and December¬†28, 2024, the notional value of the Company‚Äôs outstanding foreign currency forward contracts designated as cash flow hedges was $
2.3
 billion and $
2.2
 billion, respectively. The fair value of these contracts as of September 27, 2025 and December 28, 2024 was not material. Foreign Currency Forward Contracts Not Designated as Accounting Hedges
