Subsequent Events
Warrant
On October 5, 2025, the Company issued to OpenAI OpCo, LLC (the Warrantholder) a warrant to purchase up to an aggregate of 
160
 million shares of the Company‚Äôs common stock at an exercise price of $
0.01
 per share. The warrant shares will vest in tranches based on certain GPU purchase milestones by the Warrantholder, or its affiliates, or indirectly through third parties, and achievement of specified Company stock price targets and stock performance. Each vested tranche is further subject to the fulfillment of certain other technical and commercial conditions prior to exercise. Subject to certain terms and conditions, the warrant is exercisable through October 5, 2030. The Company expects to account for the warrant as a liability-classified financial instrument, unless the conditions for equity classification are satisfied. The grant date fair value of the warrant will be recognized as a reduction to revenue when revenue is recognized. The warrant, when classified as a liability, will be remeasured at fair value at each reporting period, with changes in fair value to be recorded within Other income (expense), net. ZT Manufacturing Business Divestiture
