Research and Development
The growth in research and development (‚ÄúR&D‚Äù) expense during the first quarter of 2026 compared to the same quarter in 2025 was primarily driven by increases in infrastructure-related costs, headcount-related expenses and engineering program costs.Selling, General and Administrative
The growth in selling, general and administrative expense during the first quarter of 2026 compared to the same quarter in 2025 was primarily driven by increases in headcount-related expenses and variable selling expenses. Apple Inc. | Q1 2026 Form 10-Q | 16
